    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493220/extras/3836c06d8d1c93b7ca1749aebb498111.avif?t=1751052822\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>femdom-themed erotic visual novel</strong>, you will follow the story of a young married couple whose sailing trip in the Mediterranean takes an unexpected turn. They find themselves in Queen's Isle, a small, isolated island nation ruled by President Danielle Ashcroft. Ashcroft and her all-female government have transformed the country into a matriarchal society where men are considered second-class citizens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the wife, Kalie, is accepted and treated with respect, the husband finds he's suddenly at the bottom of the food chain. Can he overcome the odds and escape this nightmare? It's up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique story of domination, corruption by power, intrigue and deadly conspiracies. Your choices will affect the fate of not only the main characters, but also the entire country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493220/extras/ab2ea85937cc8c58d766f2e3f41f8ddf.poster.avif?t=1751052822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493220/extras/ab2ea85937cc8c58d766f2e3f41f8ddf.webm?t=1751052822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493220/extras/ff39f8b3a5d47032235f929d44ba6b45.avif?t=1751052822\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet an extensive cast of <strong>over 20 key characters</strong>. Sexy ladies of power, ruthless politicians, bratty students, sadistic enforcers and more. All ready to bring you down and humiliate you. Will you let them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493220/extras/47b880cc2a2710b4f7d3dc3cfc3a9e9a.poster.avif?t=1751052822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493220/extras/47b880cc2a2710b4f7d3dc3cfc3a9e9a.webm?t=1751052822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493220/extras/bb59d56c1fbff6f035c2ba7338e46d59.avif?t=1751052822\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into story chapters. There are currently 10 chapters available + a bonus Christmas chapter. (Note: the game is currently in Early Access, new chapters are being released every few months). </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8,000 detailed 2K renders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120,000 words of story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Image gallery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam community items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493220/extras/ffbc30f4c10e43e085302aed77e1bcf3.poster.avif?t=1751052822\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493220/extras/ffbc30f4c10e43e085302aed77e1bcf3.webm?t=1751052822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p